<title>USA: Thorn Apple 5.9 pct stake taken by group.</title>
<headline>Thorn Apple 5.9 pct stake taken by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including DDJ Capital Management LLC said Tuesday it holds 358,140 shares or a 5.9 percent stake in Thorn Apple Valley Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it acquired the shares, which it holds for investment, at a total price of $6,254,919.</p>
<p>Thorn Apple, with headquarters in Southfield, Mich., produces fresh and smoked pork products.</p>
